 #### Liveness and failure
 
-- Never resume an agent to check on it. A resume restarts an idle agent. Probe read-only: the ledger, `units.tsv`, `gh`, pushed branches, agent state from `read history://` (registered agents) and `read proc://` (visible jobs and running agents). Transcript mtime is not liveness.
-- A silent death gets a synthetic postmortem row in the inbox (unit, failure mode, last evidence, options). Replan on evidence as it arrives. Never wait for full quiescence.
-- Retry by mode: cap-hit or oom, respawn with smaller scope. Network-drop, retry as-is. Tool-error, retry on a different model. Unknown, retry once. Two retries, then abandon the unit and replan around it.
-- A zombie that returns hours late reconciles against the current frontier and ledger before anything is accepted. Salvage unique findings through a fresh unit, never a blind merge.
